  "conditions": "比较共同标签/均分模型下的两人尾；M 只保留 d=1,2,3 回复链的 retained rows 与 b<=4 外生背景，而完整搜索对象对固定 p=4,5,6 回复表保留全部 p^2-1 行，并分别核对其保存支持。",
  "roles": {
    "M-2ca8a524bdb746d286d02ddb687f380d": "d=1 (p=6) partial-chain saved point with exact D/P=10/9 and unavoidable AB completion gains; d=2,3 give the analogous boundary.",
    "customer-attraction/protected-omission-complete-two-player-search": "完整 p^2-1-row tail search records p=4/5 ratio 1 points and a distinct p=6 ratio 14/13 point whose original six-label background is not legal."
  },
  "explanation": "相同 p=6 标签数不使两个对象同一：M 的 d=1 点只有 17 条 retained rows、不同支持并有 D/P=10/9；完整搜索的 p=6 点核过全部 35 条非自身行、D/P=14/13，并另有外生背景合法化缺口。p=4/5 的完整点又是 ratio 1 且可由 AAA 前缀实现。该比较只防止把 partial-chain obstruction、complete-tail witness 与合法根策略相互替代。",
  "scope": "context-only scope separation between retained-row obstruction and full-tail saved witnesses; no implication about any table-wide optimum or six-player theorem.",
  "refutes": "仅 refutes把“p=6”或同名保护遗漏直接当作相同支持、相同 IC 域或共同目录合法性的做法；不 refute 完整搜索保存点本身。",
